	<config>
		<script jit="1" file="driver.lua"></script>
		<documentation file="www/documentation.txt">Represents one Home Assistant cover entity (shade, blind, curtain, shutter, awning, garage door, gate) as a Control4 blind. Requires the Home Assistant Gateway driver in the project; pick the entity with the Entity Selector property or type its entity_id.</documentation>
		<properties>
